---
description: Technical and on-page SEO
globs:
  - "src/pages/**"
  - "src/layouts/**"
  - "src/components/core/SEO*"
  - "src/lib/seo/**"
alwaysApply: false
---

- Keep one descriptive `h1` and a logical heading outline.
- Provide unique title, description, canonical, language, and crawl directives.
- Use absolute valid URLs for canonical, Open Graph, and schema.
- Add structured data only when its facts are available.
- Keep sitemap and robots aligned with public routes.
- Never publish placeholder metadata or invented claims.
